<title>USA: Chase Manhattan to buy Compass Bank.</title>
<headline>Chase Manhattan to buy Compass Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chase Manhattan Bank said Friday it has signed a definitive agreement to buy the corporate trust business of Compass Bank of Birmingham Alabama.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately able to provide terms of the deal. The deal is expected to close by mid-year.</p>
<p>Chase said it plans to maintain a sales and administration office in Birmingham and expects to staff it with current corporate trust administration and management staff of Compass.</p>
</text>
